  "extraction": "scripts/k4_extract_curobo_model.py: TimeOpt optimizer KinematicsParams after a warm-up plan",
  "inertials": "panda_link1..7 and panda_hand: <inertial> of the pinned franka_panda.urdf (origin of values not documented in the repository); panda_link8, fingers, attached_object: cuRobo defaults",
  "effort_limits": "URDF <limit effort> 87 N m (joints 1-4) / 12 N m (joints 5-7), symmetric; matches the manufacturer table 'Limits for Franka Emika Robot (FER)', tau_max = 87,87,87,87,12,12,12 Nm, https://frankarobotics.github.io/docs/robot_specifications.html (read 2026-11-17). TimeOpt enforces limit_scale x effort at its constraint grid. The same table lists dtau_max = 1000 Nm/s (torque rate), NOT modelled by cuRobo: out of K4 scope.",
